<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n106556" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑϊκός</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῠ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὗς</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or
				<i>for swine,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέρμα ὑ.</span>
			<i>pig's</i> skin, <i><span class="en">
				Axionic.
				9
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. πάσχειν</span> to have
			something <i>of the swine's nature,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				1.2.30
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱερεῖον ὑϊκόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
					91.3
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				2.15.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Milet.</u>
				7.18
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑϊκή, ἡ,</span>
			<i>tax on swine</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				4.384.2
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PFay.</u>
				230
			</span></i>, al. <span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν
				ὑϊκῶν λόγον</span> dub. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>PStrassb.</u>
				112.7
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>:—cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑεικός.</span></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
